      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "APRIL'S STAR (2) is better than last start when sixth (24.17) in a T3 RSTW at this track over 400m. Can discover winning form. BOUNCING BRODIE (1) was well fancied last time and got off the mark by a neck at Traralgon over 350m (20.49). Boxed well here. Maiden this journey but has some solid runs behind her. Harder here but will be in this for a long way. WOODY GREY (4) has been on speed at the last couple here and fought on to hit the frame, last start finishing second beaten 3 lengths (23.36). Goes well out of this box with a win and three minor placings. Expecting another good run. WALTZING BLASTER (5) missed the placings here last start but is well-placed to make amends.",
